WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.720
Your will says one thing.

2
00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:05.749
Your beneficiary form says another.

3
00:00:05.749 --> 00:00:07.600
Which wins?

4
00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:11.178
For retirement accounts and life insurance,

5
00:00:11.178 --> 00:00:12.826
usually the form.

6
00:00:12.826 --> 00:00:15.901
Those assets pass to whoever is named,

7
00:00:15.901 --> 00:00:19.100
no matter what the will says.

8
00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:25.351
That means an old form can send money to a former spouse,

9
00:00:25.351 --> 00:00:28.600
or leave out a child.

10
00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:30.258
Check each account.

11
00:00:30.258 --> 00:00:31.415
Name a backup.

12
00:00:31.415 --> 00:00:32.848
Update after marriage,

13
00:00:32.848 --> 00:00:35.610
divorce, births, and deaths.

14
00:00:35.825 --> 00:00:39.272
Our checklist walks you through it.

15
00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:42.145
It takes ten minutes.
